.mca_help_general
  %h2.mca_help_general_title
    Visibility
  %p.mca_help_general_content_text
    The <b>visibility</b> and <b>date released</b> settings of a resource determines how, when, or if, it will be available to the public.
  %hr
  %h3.mca_help_general_content_title
    = 'public – url, join, index'
